{"id":"n77846-1-7","stage":3,"title":"첫인상 · 第一印象","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77846-1-7-1","ko":"유민아, 너는 지금의 남편에게 첫눈에 반했었어?","zh":"裕敏啊，你是对现在的丈夫一见钟情吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"지금의","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금의","audio":"/audio/7811cd5c9d9ba31a8ad5.mp3"}},{"text":"남편에게","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남편에게","audio":"/audio/9127017bc89ddab0e116.mp3"}},{"text":"첫눈에","meaning":"第一眼，一眼，一见","explanation":"첫눈：第一眼，一眼，一见；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"첫눈","audio":"/audio/1b4ef4c2829c13187492.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77614","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"첫눈에","audio":"/audio/c051a1182ce2f042a2fa.mp3"}},{"text":"반했었어?","meaning":"迷上 ，着迷","explanation":"반하다：迷上 ，着迷；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"반하다","audio":"/audio/1078b2f0a82ecbf61c74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57600","senseId":"1","lemma":"반하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반했었어","audio":"/audio/62194167d11754c2b76f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"a4e8e584126026d6","term":"남편","zh":"丈夫，老公","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3","entryId":"31919","definition":"夫妻关系中的男人。","pronunciation":["남편"]},{"id":"1b4ef4c2829c1318","term":"첫눈","zh":"第一眼，一眼，一见","audio":"/audio/1b4ef4c2829c13187492.mp3","entryId":"77614","definition":"第一次看见时的感觉或印象。","pronunciation":["천눈"]},{"id":"1078b2f0a82ecbf6","term":"반하다","zh":"迷上 ，着迷","audio":"/audio/1078b2f0a82ecbf61c74.mp3","entryId":"57600","definition":"对人或事物等很倾心，好像被勾住了一样。","pronunciation":["반ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2974e8074fe5e00948db.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77846-1-7-2","ko":"말도 마. 차가운 첫인상이 마음에 안 들어서 싫어했었어.","zh":"别提了。我当时不喜欢他给人的冷淡印象，所以才讨厌他的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"말도","meaning":"话、谈起（말도 마：别提了）","explanation":"말：话、谈起（말도 마：别提了）；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말도","audio":"/audio/6464a9af34c6a3e538bb.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不再做，停止","explanation":"말다：不再做，停止；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}},{"text":"차가운","meaning":"冷淡，冰冷，冷漠","explanation":"차갑다：冷淡，冰冷，冷漠；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"차갑다","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71730","senseId":"2","lemma":"차갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차가운","audio":"/audio/023be77a6d68b837f295.mp3"}},{"text":"첫인상이","meaning":"第一印象","explanation":"첫인상：第一印象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"첫인상","audio":"/audio/cdab44c8c3a2de9e8a22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77846","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫인상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"첫인상이","audio":"/audio/fbd7ea6fdb3d83e43885.mp3"}},{"text":"마음에","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음에","audio":"/audio/43f69e9e8e24ba2d0d8c.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"들어서","meaning":"中意，称心，看中","explanation":"들다：中意，称心，看中；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"11","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어서","audio":"/audio/1958524b05c63f4d1762.mp3"}},{"text":"싫어했었어.","meaning":"讨厌，不愿意","explanation":"싫어하다：讨厌，不愿意；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싫어하다","audio":"/audio/1a00f3250955b45e9391.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64963","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫어하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싫어했었어","audio":"/audio/0e5b78dce64ed150d294.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话、谈起（말도 마：别提了）","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"话、谈起（말도 마：别提了）","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不再做，停止","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"表示使无法做之前的话所指的行动。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"489db26a6bdebee8","term":"차갑다","zh":"冷淡，冰冷，冷漠","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3","entryId":"71730","definition":"性格不温和或态度不热情，非常冷冰冰。","pronunciation":["차갑따"]},{"id":"cdab44c8c3a2de9e","term":"첫인상","zh":"第一印象","audio":"/audio/cdab44c8c3a2de9e8a22.mp3","entryId":"77846","definition":"第一次接触或交往后的所得的印象。","pronunciation":["처딘상"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"中意，称心，看中","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"觉得某物好。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"1a00f3250955b45e","term":"싫어하다","zh":"讨厌，不愿意","audio":"/audio/1a00f3250955b45e9391.mp3","entryId":"64963","definition":"不合心意或不想要。","pronunciation":["시러하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd3443b4751e68959347.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=77846","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":102,"sequenceScore":2.6894,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别提了。我当时不喜欢他给人的冷淡印象，所以才讨厌他的。","裕敏啊，你是对现在的丈夫一见钟情吗？","好了！现在出发吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏啊，你是对现在的丈夫一见钟情吗？","好了！现在出发吧。","别提了。我当时不喜欢他给人的冷淡印象，所以才讨厌他的。"],"answer":2}]}
